arents":[{"sha":"2ab70bf05085f9891fa0512d2754b6e7a2fe3a75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/2ab70bf05085f9891fa0512d2754b6e7a2fe3a75","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/2ab70bf05085f9891fa0512d2754b6e7a2fe3a75"}]},{"sha":"2ab70bf05085f9891fa0512d2754b6e7a2fe3a75","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKDJhYjcwYmYwNTA4NWY5ODkxZmEwNTEyZDI3NTRiNmU3YTJmZTNhNzU","commit":{"author":{"name":"caura-deploy-bot[bot]","email":"265395343+caura-deploy-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-29T21:52:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-29T21:52:01Z"},"message":"chore: release main (#671)\n\n:robot: I have created a release *beep* *boop*\n---\n\n\n<details><summary>backend: 2.26.0</summary>\n\n##\n[2.26.0](https://github.com/caura-ai/caura-memclaw/compare/backend-v2.25.0...backend-v2.26.0)\n(2026-07-29)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **interviewer:** async submit — persist window, accept fast,\nsynthesize in the scheduler sweep\n([#667](https://github.com/caura-ai/caura-memclaw/issues/667))\n([b66f82f](https://github.com/caura-ai/caura-memclaw/commit/b66f82f3e86a7cf29eac620c97dd35b511591a32))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **core-api:** reserved-id guard as a storage-boundary chokepoint +\nepisode-path regression test\n([#670](https://github.com/caura-ai/caura-memclaw/issues/670))\n([41f1152](https://github.com/caura-ai/caura-memclaw/commit/41f1152a652f80a3c0a4ac9b6759ffb86117f18b))\n</details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release\nPlease](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See\n[documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).\n\nSigned-off-by: release-please[bot] <release-please[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: caura-deploy-bot[bot] <265395343+caura-deploy-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"424de0e3bbf71cb40edbdf6c40c12be1565e3239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/424de0e3bbf71cb40edbdf6c40c12be1565e3239"}